  "contentHtml": "<p>봄학교라는 계절학교프로그램과 과학의달 행사를 통합하여 운영합니다.</p><p>축제분위기에서 진행되는 지라 좀 재밌게 해볼 수 있는 새로운 종목을 고민하다가,</p><p>과학실복도 벽면에 칠판페인트를 칠하고,</p><p>기후위기에 대한 메세지를 전달할 수 있는 그림을 그리는 것을 시도해봤습니다^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cae67feb92c8d96253565ad50f1b482c1f66582b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cae67feb92c8d96253565ad50f1b482c1f66582b\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"1908\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76740c011fadf856af229b09bd9347b6428bc739\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76740c011fadf856af229b09bd9347b6428bc739\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"1908\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/866a9220a32fb429d1c065b13fc470b28ac80169\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/866a9220a32fb429d1c065b13fc470b28ac80169\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"1908\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bcdf043b856693705cdb4a8861d4152698e2d34\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bcdf043b856693705cdb4a8861d4152698e2d34\" data-origin-width=\"4608\" data-origin-height=\"2184\"></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
